; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
; Sector assignment for Banyu Langit symbols.
;
; Ticker,SectorName - and SECTORNAME is the only ASCII field that accepts a NAME.
; MARKET and GROUP take an ID and discard a name silently; SECTORNAME/INDUSTRYNAME
; create the sector/industry on the fly if it does not exist yet. Measured: the
; first attempt used names for MARKET/GROUP, both imports returned rc=0, and all
; 2,378 symbols stayed in market 0.
;
; $OVERWRITE 1 is required: these symbols already exist from the quote import, and
; the assignment fields only apply to existing symbols when overwrite is on.
;
; $NOQUOTES 1 because no field here is quoted; the exporter strips commas instead,
; since a quote character would be kept literally and become part of the name.
; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
$FORMAT Ticker,SectorName
$SEPARATOR ,
$SKIPLINES 0
$NOQUOTES 1
$OVERWRITE 1
$AUTOADD 0
$BREAKONERR 1
$DEBUG 1
